  <text xml:lang="sa-Latn-t-sa-Deva" type="edition">
    <body>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <p xml:id="GPV_scribal_namaskar">oṁ svasti prajābhyaḥ śrīgurave namaḥ ||</p>
        <p xml:lang="en"></p>
      </div>
      <p>oṁ</p>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <lg xml:id="GPV_1.1">
          <l>jagatsisṛkṣāpralayakriyāvidhau prayatnam unmeṣanimeṣavibhramam |</l>
          <l>vadanti yasyekṣaṇapadmapakṣmaṇāṃ parāya tasmai parameṣṭine namaḥ ||</l>
        </lg>
        <lg xml:lang="en">
          <l>Obeisance to this Highest Supreme Lord (parameṣṭhin), the playful opening and closing of the swinging lashes of whose eyes they call the effort of enacting the creation and dissolution of the Universe!</l>
        </lg>
      </div>
      <div rend="parallel">
        <lg xml:id="GPV_1.2">
          <l> te subhāsvarasahasraraśmayo<anchor xml:id="GPV_1.2_n1"/><anchor xml:id="GPV_1.2_n2"/> ye smaranti gaṇapāṭham aṣṭakāḥ |</l>
          <l>saṃsmṛtiś ca na vinopapadyate vṛttabandham iha pāṇiner api ||</l>
        </lg>
        <lg xml:lang="en">
          <l> I mean</l>
          <l>the shit<note place="foot">shit shit shit</note></l>
        </lg>
      </div>
    </body>
  </text>
